  "description": "IHttpClientFactory integration for InMemoryBucket: AddHttpClient(\"s3\").AddInMemoryBucketHandler() routes a named or typed HttpClient to the in-memory server, for the MinIO SDK or hand-written S3 clients. No AWS SDK dependency.",
